nt, please.\n\nCharacters:\n1. Female gyaru (Nanami)\n> Plump body\n> long brown hair ; exposed forehead ; hair slicked-back + white hairband\n> Cool and stern personality, but actually sweet and lewd underneath\n> Same outfit as those girls:\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/109852798\n2. Shota character (Keita)\n> Nanami's neighbour\n\nSituation:\nNanami frequently comes over to Keita's house to help him with his homework. They have developed a sexual relationship over time. Whenever Keita does well in his studies, Nanami rewards him with sex. After helping him study, Nanami gives Keita a paizuri. Finally, they have doggystyle sex. Nanami favors this position because she doesn't want Keita to see her \"panting face\" (アヘ顔). She tries to keep her image as a reliable older sister figure.\n\nText in japanese is OK!\n\nThank you! I hope I was understandable. Sorry for not using DeepL, but I had issues with it in the past.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gumi_cho_pine/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b899232c/uploads/origins/f104985b-9d6e-4c96-8b53-ea9e300a7a9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d516135604e81207d726917240e950d6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b899232c/uploads/origins/f104985b-9d6e-4c96-8b53-ea9e300a7a9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d516135604e81207d726917240e950d6, https://si.imgix.net/b899232c/uploads/origins/f104985b-9d6e-4c96-8b53-ea9e300a7a9a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=62197649ceef3b3ac7b8ab9cd44ac377 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b899232c/uploads/origins/f104985b-9d6e-4c96-8b53-ea9e300a7a9a?bg=%23f